<title>UK: Kingfisher to sell businesses to U.S.partner.</title>
<headline>Kingfisher to sell businesses to U.S.partner.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kingfisher Plc said on Wednesday that it would sell its 50 percent stake in Staples UK for 23.5 million stg to Staples Inc, its joint venture partner in the United States.</p>
<p>The company was also selling its 40 percent stake in Maxi-Papier for DM 16.6 million (around 6.5 million stg) to Staples Inc, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
